      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 1/8 (25 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Flyby.*** The snake doesn't provoke an Opportunity Attack when it flies out of an enemy's reach.

      ## Actions

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* 1 Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=2d4,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Poison damage.

